tudio\\app.py` (both have `/shutdown` endpoint added)\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Update `desktop_app/server_manager.py`**:\n   - In `ServerInstance.test()`: check `if not self.is_running(): return {\"success\": False, \"error\": \"السيرفر متوقف حالياً. اضغط على 'تشغيل السيرفر' أولاً ثم أعد اختبار الاتصال.\", \"stopped\": True}`.\n   - Enhance `ServerInstance.stop()`: call `/shutdown` endpoint first, then terminate port PIDs.\n   - Separate server logging: add `server_log_callback` and stream subprocess stdout to it.\n2. **Update `desktop_app/backend.py`**:\n   - Add `self._server_logs = []`.\n   - Expose `get_server_logs() -> str` and `clear_server_logs() -> dict`.\n   - In `add_server_log(line)`: dispatch `new_server_log` event to window via `evaluate_js`.\n3. **Update `desktop_app/templates/index.html`**:\n   - **CSS**: Add `overflow-x: hidden !important;` to `body`, `.app-layout`, `.main-content`, and `.screen`.\n   - **Cards Grid**: Set `.servers-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }`.\n   - **URLs**: Add `word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: anywhere;` to `.server-detail-value`.\n   - **Sidebar**: Shorten nav item text to `إدارة السيرفرات`, reduce padding to `12px 16px`, set `overflow-y: auto;` on `.sidebar` so `إغلاق البرنامج` is always visible.\n   - **Dedicated Terminal**: Replace diagnostic box with full **AI Server Live Console** (`#ai-server-terminal`) connected to `new_server_log` event.\n   - Add `loadServerLogs()` when switching to `screen-servers`.\n4. **Compile & Package**:\n   - Run `py_compile` on all modified files.\n   - Run `python scripts/package_production.py`.\n5. **Advise User**:\n   - Provide the 1-line command to run once in their open Administrator PowerShell to clear the old orphaned PIDs on 8000:\n     `Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 8000 | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.OwningProcess -Force }`\n   - Test starting/stopping both servers and verify the new responsive layout and dedicated server terminal.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Must NOT have any horizontal scrollbars on any screen resolution.\n- The pipeline terminal (`screen-logs`) must remain completely separate from the server console (`screen-servers`).\n- Exit button in sidebar must be clearly visible and accessible.\n- All actions must be verified and synchronized with `dist_production`.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 241 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790101953275]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790101953275.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-22T18:32:33Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006220414]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006220414.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006245677]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006245677.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790008142552]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790008142552.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T16:29:03Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790030764891]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790030764891.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:46:21Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790030964763]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antig